    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0929",
      "reading_order": 1338,
      "section": "8.3 Oil specifications",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 124.03,
        "t": 685.3360225,
        "r": 508.7754534999983,
        "b": 661.01854
      },
      "content": "Always drain the compressor oil at all drain points. Used oil left in the compressor can contaminate the oil system and can shorten the lifetime of the new oil.",
      "section_id": "sec_8_3",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_8",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_8",
          "title": "8       Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_8_3",
          "title": "8.3 Oil specifications"
        }
      ],
      "page": 120,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0930",
      "reading_order": 1339,
      "section": "8.3 Oil specifications",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 124.03,
        "t": 720.9760225,
        "r": 512.7670750000001,
        "b": 685.31854
      },
      "content": "Never mix lubricants of different brands or types as they may not be compatible and the oil mix will have inferior properties. A label, indicating the type of oil filled ex-factory, is stuck on the air receiver/oil tank.",
      "section_id": "sec_8_3",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_8",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_8",
          "title": "8       Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_8_3",
          "title": "8.3 Oil specifications"
        }
      ],
      "page": 120,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0931",
      "reading_order": 1340,
      "section": "8.3 Oil specifications",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 57.67,
        "t": 639.601,
        "r": 529.5193999999999,
        "b": 601.6245999999999
      },
      "content": "It is strongly recommended to use genuine Atlas Copco Lubricants. They are the result of years of field experience and research in our labs. See section Preventive maintenance schedule for replacement intervals and section Service Kits for part number information.",
      "section_id": "sec_8_3",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_8",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_8",
