        "t": 413.6411999999998,
        "r": 458.2525999999993,
        "b": 401.46419999999983
      },
      "content": "Roto-Xtend Duty Fluid is the standard oil for compressors equipped with freeze protection.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1343",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_8",
