        "r": 524.1833,
        "b": 289.5633999999998
      },
      "content": "Atlas Copco's Roto-Foodgrade fluid is a unique high-quality synthetic lubricant, specially created for oil-injected screw compressors that provide air for the food industry. This lubricant keeps the compressor in excellent condition. Roto-Foodgrade Fluid can be used for compressors operating at ambient temperatures between 0 °C and 40 °C .",
